direction: right
cron: 06:07 cron
agent: rss / editorial agent
model: claude -p
parse: parse_json
merger: merger
qa: QA judge
email: daily email
cron -> agent: start run
agent -> model: prompt + session rules
model -> parse: preamble + JSON
parse -> agent: "{} no error"
agent -> merger: empty briefing, exit 0
merger -> qa: fewer stories
qa -> email: all green
